        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KC2, Solid Brass 1\" Retro Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. The Solid Brass 1 Inch Retro Cabinet Knob brings to mind the retro look of the 50's and 60's. For use on any cabinet door, furniture piece, or cabinet drawer. Made from solid brass. Available in 8 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KC24-Specification.gif?v=1704354662\" width=\"315\" height=\"132\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KC24 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/1-inch-satin-stainless-steel-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc24u32d\"><b>Stainless Steel  Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a> and a smaller <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-4-inch-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc20\"><b>3/4\" Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KC24 Retro Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Base: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KC24.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KC24 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
